  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why It Matters",
      "char_file": "탄산음료_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "About 1 in 3 US adults",
        "have metabolic syndrome",
        "",
        "It is not one disease but",
        "three or more risk factors",
        "showing up at the same time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Belly Fat Starts It",
      "char_file": "탄산음료_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Fat in the abdomen raises",
        "free fatty acids in the blood",
        "",
        "That blunts how your body",
        "responds to insulin, and",
        "inflammation makes it worse"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "What Helps First",
      "char_file": "다이어트도시락_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Losing 3 to 5% of current",
        "weight already helps manage",
        "cholesterol and blood sugar",
        "",
        "The DPP trial aimed at 7%"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Where the Lines Fall",
      "char_file": "흰빵_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Waist over 40 in (men) or 35 in (women),",
        "BP 130/85 or higher,",
        "fasting sugar 100 mg/dL or higher,",
        "triglycerides over 150,",
        "HDL under 40 (men) or 50 (women)",
        "",
        "Three of five is the threshold"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Eat the DASH Way",
      "char_file": "흰빵_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Fruits, vegetables, whole grains",
        "",
        "Limit saturated fat, sodium,",
        "added sugars and alcohol —",
        "NHLBI's first-line advice here"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Mostly Silent",
      "char_file": "알약_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "High BP, high triglycerides and",
        "low HDL usually cause no symptoms",
        "",
        "Blurred vision, extra thirst or",
        "night urination can signal high",
        "blood sugar — raise them at a visit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "150 Minutes a Week",
      "char_file": "운동화_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "The DPP paired 150 minutes of",
        "weekly exercise with a 7% weight goal",
        "",
        "Result: 58% lower chance of",
        "type 2 diabetes over 3 years"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "closing": {
    "headline": [
      [
        "Waist, blood pressure, sugar, triglycerides, HDL —",
        "one process moves all five"
      ],
      [
        "Which is why fixing the process",
        "moves all five back"
      ]
    ],
    "tip": [
      "Take the pairing the DPP tested:",
      "a 7% weight goal plus 150 minutes a week"
